question:
Hàm sau trả về gì với list 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4 -> 5?
`function middle(head) {
  let slow = head;
  let fast = head;
  while (fast && fast.next) {
    slow = slow.next;
    fast = fast.next.next;
  }
  return slow.val;
}`

questionEn:
